Source-reviewed orchestration. Nested semantics remain open; no runtime acceptance
claimed. Endpoint recovery change 6cbd9cc63 reviewed. Play uses exact OperationPrincipal
equality; lab access uses tenant equality. Browser principals retain provider, API-key
principals use display prefix, and header/dev tenants produce no RequestPrincipal.
Retained state is now reread inside the session gate; completed finish is idempotent at
HTTP level. POST /chess/play/{sessionId}/recording/retry requires a retryable retained
recording. Shared-writer retry semantics remain a separate boundary.
